sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant G as Agent
    participant T as MCP tool executor
    participant R as Guidance rule (registry key mcp.after_cohorts_create)
    participant P as PostHog analytics
    participant A as HogFlow API
    G->>T: cohorts-create
    T->>R: evaluate(state, call), success outcome
    R->>R: read holdout and xpm-mcp-placement from request flags
    R->>P: $feature_flag_called for both flags, organization group
    alt treated arm
        R->>R: mint attemptId, payload text
        R-->>T: notice: offer a broadcast to this cohort, pass entry_attempt_id
    else control or holdout
        R-->>T: no text, outcome flag_off
    end
    T->>P: tool call event {mcp_guidance_rule, outcome, attemptId}
    T-->>G: cohort result plus notice
    G->>T: broadcasts-create {cohort filter, entry_attempt_id}
    T->>A: hog_flows_create {entry_attempt_id}
    A->>P: hog_flow_created {hog_flow_id, entry_attempt_id}
